=7f20f&oh=00_AQQg7j54PPStcUFexhvRYWRtig1CMNa-h84bRCbmuvulwg&oe=6AF5EA1B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HUHUHU.png", "id": "2035477956919467", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392314_2035477963586133_3759903070723388888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nrxq-9cPrkcQ7kNvwHLZdAK&_nc_oc=Adr6AhZ8J3QZ1Sqcn2u7vgkGi0qr-373qC-OEBI8ZmuNkXlQgZzrpPsUBWzWATccb3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRUIsyJRBLMyICX7QNwxCFRBwpRnDV6rM7JdYhP96C5Dw&oe=6AF5BFA5"}, "display_name": "VITRIOL - DEMO", "keywords": ["Physics", "Fast", "Shooter", "Heavy", "Retro"], "long_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\nFast and Loose - Long strides and Heavy Blows churn through the wretched horde with a freedom and ease VR is yet to experience.\n\nHand to Skull - Physics based Enemies and an in-depth elbow estimation system provide a physicality and presence to the combat which enhances gameplay beyond what was previously possible.\n\nBlood, Fire and Pillars of Smoke - Sinners malformed, The Righteous Risen. The Wrath of God in Iron Men. All this scored by a soundtrack that hits just as hard, drowned in a haze just as thick. ", "short_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Lee Wilson", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/VitriolDev/Privacy-Policy/blob/main/VITRIOL%20DEMO%20Privacy%20Policy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lee Wilson", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@VITRIOL_VR", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [],